An '''unnamed island''' in the [[Orange Islands]] appears in ''[[PK04|Pikachu's Rescue Adventure]]''. Its location is unknown, though assuming the events of the short take place following ''[[EP104|Bound for Trouble]]'' (the short, along with ''[[M02|The Power of One]]'', hit theaters two days after the episode aired), it is quite likely one of the two tiny islands to the northeast of [[Fairchild Island]].

It is unknown if this island has a permanent population; however, there is a {{wp|camping site}} located there.

